# SkillSoundgrp.dat of Essence 542: the rows of P152 with 24 voices of each kind in place of 19. The first 18 are
# those of P152, then come the Sylph, the High Elves, a male figure whose voices are named MCrow, and one more.
# The tables of Essence 542 read so, in both worlds.
format  1
file    SkillSoundgrp.dat
title   Essence 542 and later
like    P152 and later

replace castVoices {
    list 24 name castVoices  # a voice of each player figure as the cast starts, MFighter to MCrow and one more
}
replace shotVoices {
    list 24 name shotVoices  # a voice of each player figure as the spell leaves
}
